      "contextBefore": "The code then computes the four nearest neighbors, based on Euclidean distance, to the sample data point at index 7 of the samples data.",
      "contextAfter": "On return, the `indices` array contains the values `[7, 2, 4, 6]` and the distances array contains the values `[0.0, 1.4142135, 2.236068, 3.0]`.",
